This directory is a port of the Caelestia shell to waku.

Upstream: https://github.com/caelestia-dots/shell
Upstream commit: b51fdb3 (2026-10-29)

The port is a derivative work of Caelestia and is licensed under the GPL-3.0 (see LICENSE).
Nothing from this port, not even a snippet, may be added to the MIT-licensed waku repository.
waku loads the port at run time as a config home only.

The unmodified upstream source is not kept here; fetch it from the repository above at the commit above.
Everything in this directory is modified or new.
Assets from upstream: bongocat.gif, dino.png. assets/windows.svg is the Windows logo, a Microsoft trademark, used to mark the host OS.
Fonts are not shipped. tools\install-fonts.ps1 downloads Material Symbols Rounded (Apache-2.0, Google,
https://github.com/google/material-design-icons) and Google Sans Flex (SIL OFL 1.1, Google,
https://github.com/google/fonts) from upstream.
